}

docs {
  ## Create Gig — Authenticated Seller
  
  Creates a new gig. The seller is extracted from the JWT token.
  Replace `CATEGORY_UUID` with an actual category ID.
  
  ### Requirements
  - Exactly 3 packages (BASIC, STANDARD, PREMIUM)
  - Each tier must be unique
  - Slug is auto-generated from title
  
  ### Success Response (201)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Gig created successfully",
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```
}
